		{
			dependencies: [
				"1E1870FAD295DEDE"
				"0F409DACBEB7BBF8"
			]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"&5The Build Tool is any ruler's truly faithful companion. It is the only way to impose order upon your landscape."
				""
				"&5Place the Town Hall block to claim your territory. However, the Builder's Hut must be constructed first. Your Town Hall serves as the heart of the colony, but the Builder is the hands. Construct the hands first!"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&aRight-click any solid block to open the Build Preview GUI. Use the controls on the right to shift, rotate, and align your building before placing it.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			icon: "structurize:sceptergold"
			id: "0D6E099A1A242153"
			rewards: [{
