			dependencies: ["583A7AA84FEC027F"]
			description: ["&5Lumber forms the skeleton of your empire. The Forester harvests this resource and replants to ensure future supply. They will clear the surrounding area indiscriminately unless you impose your will. Use the zoning tool within the hut block to dictate exactly where they are permitted to cut."]
