		{
			dependencies: ["583A7AA84FEC027F"]
			description: ["&5Tear the wealth from the earth. The Miner drives a shaft deep into the ground, determined by the Mine's level, before branching out to strip the stone away. They will mostly return with cobblestone, but occasionally, they will unearth precious ore. Do not scowl at the stone; even an Emperor must wait for the Wheel to turn in their favor.&r"]
