		{
			dependencies: ["583A7AA84FEC027F"]
			description: [
				"&5The waters yield sustenance for those willing to take it. The Fisher provides early provisions, assuming you possess the string to equip them. With persistence, they may even drag up useful debris alongside their catch."
				""
				"&5If you have settled in a barren land without water, construct a 6x6x1 basin yourself. The fish do not care if the lake is man-made, and neither should you."
