		{
			dependencies: ["583A7AA84FEC027F"]
			description: [
				"&5There is no dignity in labor that can be delegated. Are you an architect or are you a plowhorse? Construct a Farm and assign a subject to the fields.&r"
				""
				"&5I recommend cultivating carrots. They require no fuel to prepare. Every piece of coal saved on cooking is a piece of coal used for smelting iron.&r"
			]
