		{
			dependencies: ["583A7AA84FEC027F"]
			description: [
				"&5A Warehouse is the distinction between a ruler and a hoarder.&r"
				""
				"&5No more hiding your loot in scattered holes like a common wash-bear. If you cannot account for every ingot and log in a central ledger, you do not own them, you are merely borrowing them from the dirt.&r"
			]
