		{
			dependencies: ["1BB571557F74D3A1"]
			dependency_requirement: "one_started"
			description: [
				"&5Some rulers arrive by the tide, others by the winds. Whether you choose a vessel of the sea or the sky, the principle remains: space must be conquered before it is occupied."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&a(The ship cannot be placed if objects block the area. Right-click the supply ship on the ground to see a 3D preview. Use the arrow controls to position the camp within your cleared space, then click the green checkmark to place it. If placement fails, the terrain is still in the way, remove obstacles until it fits - these obstacles may be underwater. Red lines will mark spots that need further clearing.)&r"
			]
