			dependencies: ["0D6E099A1A242153"]
			description: [
				"&5The barbarians possess a crude sort of wisdom. These tomes, stripped from their cold hands, pulse with light when a raid is imminent. Keep one on your person as a warning. Forewarned is forearmed."
				""
				"&5Later, should you find a literate subject to staff an Enchanter's Tower, they can distill this savage magic into usable enchanted books."
