				"&5Equip these Goggles to preview a structure at Level 5 before construction begins.&r"
				""
				"&5Builders are blind instruments, they do not think, they place blocks. If you order them to build a Town Hall inside a lake, they will drown trying to obey you.&r"
				""
				"&5I once had an architect block my view of the sunset with a misplaced tower. I buried him beneath the foundation. He supports the colony much better as a structural pillar than he ever did as a planner.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			id: "120152510AD4B59A"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7BB544852E19F144"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 5
			}]
			subtitle: "It’s A Samsquanch!"
			tasks: [{
