						Damage: 0
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 2.5d
			y: -12.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7"]
			description: [
				"&5A lone guard tower is a semblance of protection, a deterrant against lowly pickpockets and lazy workers. A Barracks is for war. Unlike the standard tower, a Barracks Tower houses an additional soldier for every level built. Five blades, bows, or firearms per tower.&r"
				""
				"&5Do not be stingy with lives. Eventually, you will need two such Barracks, packed with &mexpendable&r &5devoted souls.&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&5King Aethelgard claimed spies were a waste of coin. He saved fifty gold pieces, right up until the moment a raiding party severed his head during supper. Learn from his headless corpse: at Level 3, pay the gold to track the barbarians before they breach your walls.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "5A11A2FC20E5CE2A"
			rewards: [
