		{
			dependencies: ["15B51FB56A64C303"]
			description: [
				"&5Wood is the poor man's stone, but essential nonetheless. The Sawmill houses the Carpenter, who will craft items primarily composed of timber, relieving you of the indignity of manufacturing your own fences.&r"
				""
				"&5Do not be fooled into thinking the colony runs itself yet. You must hand-feed the recipes to the Carpenter. Prioritize what your Builder demands most often.&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&5At level 1, the Carpenter is dim-witted, capable of recalling a mere 10 recipes. Upgrade the building, and the recipe capacity doubles per level. I once tried to teach a novice carpenter an 11th recipe. He wept until I burned the blueprint.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "0EBB4E5195610A82"
			rewards: [
