		{
			dependencies: ["15B51FB56A64C303"]
			description: [
				"&5There is a certain irony in ruling: one must manage gold and garbage with equal attention. The Composter's Hut houses a subject designated to churn organic refuse into fertilizer.&r"
				""
				"&5It is a smelly, thankless task, which is exactly why you are not doing it. The resulting muck is vital for the Farmer and Florist to accelerate their yields.&r"
				""
				"&5Do not fall into the trap of the Royal Gardener who refused to use compost because the stench 'offended his delicate nose.' The famine that winter was far more offensive.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "6B0CE8AD86991E28"
			rewards: [
