		}
		{
			dependencies: ["15B51FB56A64C303"]
			description: [
				"&5The Mystical Site is a monument to superstition. It requires no worker, yet increases happiness simply by looming there. Peasants are easily impressed by glowing rocks.&r"
				""
				"&5It also boosts the Undertaker's chance of resurrection. Essential, since your subjects seem intent on dying in the most preventable ways possible.&r"
				""
				"&5Do not build more than one. The magic does not multiply. If only immortality were that easy...&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "206159A3C7A78447"
			rewards: [{
