		}
		{
			dependencies: ["583A7AA84FEC027F"]
			description: [
				"&5The Guard Tower houses exactly one sentinel. Your subjects are notoriously fragile; they require constant visual reassurance of their safety. Aim for a ratio of two guards for every three civilians.&r"
				""
				"&5Once assigned, the guard sleeps in the tower rather than the general housing. This frees up space for a new &mtaxpayer&r&5 citizen. No sense in letting a warm bed go cold.&r"
			]
