		{
			dependencies: ["15B51FB56A64C303"]
			description: [
				"&5A splash of color often convinces a peasant that their hovel is a palace. The Dyer's Hut houses a specialist dedicated to crafting pigments and staining items, including exotic materials like Red Nether Bricks and Dark Prismarine.&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&5However, they refuse to touch Concrete or Concrete Powder. I once argued this with my Head Dyer.&r"
				""
				"&d\"My Lord, concrete is heavy and ruins my delicate mixing spoons.\"&r"
				"&5\"It is dust and water! Just add the blue!\"&r"
				"&d\"It requires a mixer, not a cauldron! It won't bind!\"&r"
				""
				"&5Insolent, but correct. Leave the concrete to the brutes; the Dyer has soft hands.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
