		{
			dependencies: ["15B51FB56A64C303"]
			description: [
				"&5The Flower Shop houses the Florist, who cultivates flora for your colony provided they are supplied with compost and an axe. Yes, an axe. Apparently, aggressive pruning is the only method these peasants understand.&r"
				""
				"&5Production is strictly capped by the building's level. At level 1, the daily limit is a meager 4 flowers. Level 2 grants you 8.&r"
				""
				"&5By level 5, the daily maximum reaches 20. If your dye production requires more volume, simply build another shop.&r"
			]
