		{
			dependencies: ["1BB571557F74D3A1"]
			description: [
				"&5Left to their own devices, your guards will likely stand idle while raiders burn the bakery. They require specific direction.&r"
				""
				"&aShift + right-click the Rallying Banner on a Guard Tower or Barracks to link those soldiers to the item. When used, the banner summons them to your side.&r"
