		{
			dependencies: ["5A11A2FC20E5CE2A"]
			description: [
				"&5Sending raw recruits to the front lines is a waste of investment. The Combat Academy allows Knights in Training to hone their skills without the inconvenience of dying.&r"
				""
				"&5Provide them with a sword and shield, and they will vigorously attack practice dummies (very fierce pumpkins atop hay bales). It is hardly glorious, but it ensures they survive long enough to be useful.&r"
