		{
			dependencies: ["15B51FB56A64C303"]
			description: [
				"&5I once watched a Level 5 Builder walk into a ravine. I mourned for three days; not the man, no, but the three weeks of training time I lost! It was a staggering blow to my production schedule.&r"
				""
				"&5The Undertaker attempts to mitigate this waste. When a subject dies, a grave appears. The Undertaker will rush to retrieve it before the world erases the evidence.&r"
				""
				"&5If successful, the subject may be revived to resume their duties. If not, the Undertaker handles their final affairs, and buries them neatly in the Graveyard.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "33058894ACD9CB06"
			rewards: [
