		{
			dependencies: ["583A7AA84FEC027F"]
			description: [
				"&5Your subjects require a designated place to sleep, lest they wander blindly into the night. The Residence houses them, leveling it increases bed count and population capacity.&r"
				""
				"&5Don't rush the placement. If a worker must traverse the entire colony to reach their job, their mood - and work ethic - plummets.&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&d\"My Lord, the lumberjack complains the commute is 'unbearable'.\"&r"
				"&5\"He lives fifty paces from the sawmill.\"&r"
				"&d\"He claims the terrain is uneven.\"&r"
				"&5\"Move his house next to the sawblade. If he complains again, move him &linto&r&5 the sawblade.\"&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "72C749AD9F1C634E"
			rewards: [
