		{
			dependencies: ["15B51FB56A64C303"]
			description: [
				"&5Do you recall the indignity of the early days? Sprinting between hovels, shoving raw potatoes into the mouths of coughing peasants to stave off influenza? It is hardly behavior befitting a ruler.&r"
				""
				"&5Construct the Hospital. The Healer will automatically administer cures to the sick and injured, provided your warehouses supply the necessary ingredients.&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&5Do not hesitate. My cousin, Baron Von Sneze, believed healthcare was a \"luxury for the weak.\" His reign - and his bloodline - ended in a singular, wet explosion of mucus. A tragic, yet avoidable, legacy.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "74C114D0C0D4D374"
			rewards: [
