			description: [
				"&5Raw grain is fit only for livestock. The Baker refines ingredients into dough - be it for bread, cookies, cakes, or pumpkin pies - and commits them to the furnace.&r"
				""
				"&5Do not expect them to labor without direction, however. They require a specific order to begin: a demand from the Cook, an order via the Postbox, or a directive to maintain minimum stock in the Warehouse.&r"
