			description: [
				"&5Before proceeding, verify that you have unlocked the research 'Raising the Dead.'&r"
				""
				"&5Emperor Sullivus the Stubborn refused to research this, claiming he 'would not negotiate with the grim reaper.' The reaper was equally unamicable to negotiations, and unionized the local cemetery against Sullivus' colonists. Sullivus was deposed by his own great-grandfather's skeleton. Embarrassing.&r"
