		{
			dependencies: ["583A7AA84FEC027F"]
			description: [
				"&5Sleep is a regrettable biological weakness, yet your subjects insist upon it. Without a proper bed, they wander aimlessly or, worse, succumb to nocturnal horrors.&r"
				""
				"&d\"Sire, must we provide them with actual pillows?\"&r&5 my Treasurer once asked. &d\"A sack of gravel is cheaper.\"&r"
				"&5\"Try sleeping on gravel, Jenkins,\" I replied. \"If their backs break, who carries my sedan chair? You?\"&r"
				""
				"&5He stopped complaining. Mostly because I made him sleep on gravel for a week.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
