				"&5Builders often move with the urgency of a glacier. If their pace offends you, equip this hammer.&r"
				""
				"&5With the requisite materials in your inventory, tap &a(right-click)&r&5 anywhere within the construction zone. You will instantly place the blocks, effectively doing their job for them. It is manual labor, yes, but preferable to waiting.&r"
