			description: [
				"&5The Cookery houses the Chef, whose duty is to convert raw ingredients into edible meals whenever a request is issued.&r"
				""
				"&5Ensure this facility feeds into your Restaurants to automatically keep them stocked. A well-managed supply chain prevents the inconvenience of famine.&r"
