		{
			dependencies: ["583A7AA84FEC027F"]
			description: [
				"&5Left to their own devices, a starving colonist will consume raw meat or even rotten flesh. While I admire the survival instinct, the resulting sickness is a drain on productivity.&r"
				""
				"&5Hungry citizens gather at the Restaurant to receive prepared meals from the Cook, provided you have established supply lines like a Fisher's Hut or Cowhand's Hut.&r"
				""
				"&5Note: The ovens require fuel. Configure the settings to accept charcoal, sticks, or planks. No matter how firey their eyes, your Cook cannot grill a steak by simply glaring at it.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
