		{
			dependencies: ["583A7AA84FEC027F"]
			description: [
				"&5Construct the Tavern as soon as possible. It provides housing for four citizens, which is precisely the burden you begin with.&r"
				""
				"&5Furthermore, the Tavern attracts visitors seeking residency. You may recruit them by fulfilling their requests for specific items.&r"
				""
				"&5Scrutinize their attributes before hiring. Do not squander resources recruiting a subject who is incompetent at everything but breathing and eating!&r"
			]
