		{
			dependencies: ["15B51FB56A64C303"]
			description: [
				"&5The Crusher performs the mindless labor of pulverizing stone: Cobblestone to Gravel, Gravel to Sand, and Sand to Clay.&r"
				""
				"&5Mind the daily quota. A Level 1 hut manages a pitiful 16 items. If you demand a glass palace with such meager production, you'll die of old age before even the ground floor can be glazed.&r"
				""
				"&5Invest in upgrades. At Level 2 the limit hits 64, and by Level 5, they can crush 999 items a day. Anything less is just a waste of a good mallet.&r"
