			description: [
				"&5Do not let your farmers idle. A single worker is perfectly capable of tending to five fields simultaneously. If they aren't sweating, they aren't working.&r"
				""
				"&d\"Five fields?\"&r&5 my Head Gardener gasped. &d\"Surely you jest, Emperor? They have but two hands!\"&r"
				""
				"&5\"Then they must move those hands faster. And tell them to stop complaining. Back in my day, we farmed volcanoes. Uphill. Both ways.\"&r"
